  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Minted greens are a fresh and zesty mix of herbs that brighten any meal with bold flavor and aroma. Blended with parsley, cilantro, and mint, they pair perfectly with lemon, honey, and light dressings for a refreshing side. Versatile and healthy, minted greens can be tossed into salads, served over toast, or added to soups and grain bowls. Quick to prepare and full of nutrients, minted greens bring a vibrant, cooling touch to everyday dishes.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-minted-greens\">Why You’ll Love This minted greens</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-minted-greens\">How to Make Minted Greens</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-minted-greens\">Pro Tips for Making Minted Greens</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-minted-greens\">How to Serve this minted greens</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-minted-greens\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This minted greens</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Brightens up any dish with a refreshing twist.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Boosts your meals with vibrant color and flavor.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Packed with nutrients for a healthy boost.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile for salads, sides, and garnishes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to grow at home for fresh access.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-3488\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"3488\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-colum